  "headline": "Bivalirudin is not on FDA's shortage list; Corvale General has 12.7 days on hand and Corvale East has 30.8 days on hand",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "D1", "D2"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include bivalirudin as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 136 vials of the 250 mg injection with a daily use of 10.7 vials, giving 12.7 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 270 vials of the 250 mg injection with a daily use of 8.8 vials, giving 30.8 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule‑based best option is to buy from Accord Healthcare, Inc., which is also not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Accord Healthcare's label names no plant we could place, so the manufacturing site cannot be verified from the label.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Dr. Reddy's label lists Gland Pharma Limited (FEI 3002647489) as a registered plant with a VAI inspection on 2024-07-25.",
      "cites": ["E9", "E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Check whether the Accord product can be sourced from a registered facility with an acceptable inspection history.",
      "cites": ["D4", "E9"]
    }
  ]
}
